# APK / app-analysis artifacts — DO NOT COMMIT.
#
# `android/` holds ~529 MB of APK splits plus `rivian-secrets.txt`, a raw
# secrets-scanner dump. Even though that dump turned out to be false positives
# (see recon/apk-secrets-triage.txt), raw scanner output must never be committed:
# scanner output is unverified by definition, and a real credential would land in
# git history permanently.
#
# Precedent: ../axelspringerse/creds/.gitignore
android/

# Catch any stray key material / scanner output anywhere under this engagement.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx
*-secrets.txt
*-secrets.json

# Authenticated-testing session material (see creds/.gitignore).
creds/
